Z||000000||My7Fieros||01-31-2001||09:04 PM||||I just bought an 84 and Im going to do a rebuild...actually my roommate is, he's the mechanical wiz. Anyway, I saw a couple of pics..one was a purple and red duke (cant remember whos it is..sorry) and I saw a pic of a blue duke to. Looking for some more to get ideas! Im not going to change engines, just going to rebuild this one, but would like to "spice" it up a bit. TIA! Brian<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://tgowens.com/My7Fieros_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
