Z||000003||SloPonti||02-01-2001||12:06 AM||||the red and purple hopped up iron duck is mine! it is also on ira's site! i redid the motor myseld in shop class-bored .40 over-added hypertectic pistons-new everything in motor-high volume oil pump-three way valve grinding-new hooker tri y header-holley perfromance throttle body-competition cam from comp cams-msd blaster coil-accell 8mm wires-ram air intake-high flow cat! all in all i am happy with the motor! not bad for an iron duck! <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/sloponti/fiero1.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/sloponti/fiero1.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/sloponti/fiero2.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/sloponti/fiero2.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/sloponti/fiero3.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/sloponti/fiero3.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/sloponti/fiero4.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/sloponti/fiero4.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/sloponti/fiero5.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/sloponti/fiero5.jpg</A> ||||reg||1
